<div id="u-credit-00169-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-chen-luo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6143533); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6143533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609227978" alt="the chen luo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6143533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-chen-luo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6143533); return false;">the chen luo</a></span></p>
